---
title: Lima Bean, Carrot Sausage Casserole
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 40 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sausage{2%lbs}
@lima beans{2%cans}
@sliced carrots{2%cans} (or cook one bunch of carrots, sliced)
@white sauce

Brown sausage and mix with carrots and lima beans in a large casserole dish. Mix with thicken white sauce. Bake for 40 minutes at 350 degrees.
